    "title": "Beep Beep! How To Cycle as Chicly as Jennifer Lawrence - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Anna Cafolla ,\n14 hours ago Looking hot on your Electra e-bike isn’t the first priority when navigating New York City traffic. But behind not swerving into a hot dog stand or faceplanting a Tesla, cycling chicly (and safely!) requires only a little bit of forward planning and perusing your own closet, without the need to forgo your own personal style—just ask Jennifer Lawrence. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
